cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use blas-microbenchmark in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: blas-microbenchmark
abstract: >-
  Command-line microbenchmarks for BLAS routines: one executable per
  routine, the same options for all of them, results that record the
  library and the machine they come from, and a self-contained HTML report
  to compare BLAS libraries.
authors:
  - given-names: Mathieu
    family-names: Caissa
version: 1.1.2
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/MathieuCAISSA/blas-microbenchmark"
url: "https://mathieucaissa.github.io/blas-microbenchmark/"
keywords:
  - BLAS
  - benchmark
  - microbenchmark
  - linear algebra
  - HPC
  - performance
  - OpenBLAS
  - BLIS
